# ⭐ OPIc Sample Answer - Day28

My daily life has changed quite a lot compared with a few years ago.

It used to be more relaxed because I had more free time and fewer responsibilities.

But now, I have a much busier schedule, so I have to manage my time more carefully.

For example, I spend more time studying and planning what I need to do each day.

The main reason is that I have more things to take care of now.

As a result, I don't have as much free time as I used to.

Personally, I think the change is positive because I've become more organized and responsible.
